Unofficial fix for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3781790213]Combat Statistics[/url] by [i]Blackdevil[/i]. All credit goes to original author.

As with the original mod, this is only available in the public-beta branch.
This is only an extension, so the original mod is required. It doesn't affect gameplay, and can be used in multiplayer without other players needing it.

[b]What it fixes[/b]
- Continue button on defeat or victory screens, since [i]The Fool[/i] update [i]v0.113[/i] in November, 2026
- [i]Wuppy[/i]'s damage absorbed and faints not being tracked, new since [i]v0.113[/i]
- [i]Osty[/i] damage not being tracked, since [i]v0.113[/i]
- combat stats only working on the first fight of a new run with certain other mods installed ([i]Into the Spireverse[/i], for example)

The code is public and viewable here, github.com/jciurc/sts2-combat-stats-fix
